<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How Creators Club collects, uses, shares, keeps and deletes personal data, including data from Instagram, YouTube and payments."
  updated="13 November 2026"
  summary="The short version: we use your data, and data Instagram and YouTube send us, only to run Creators Club for you. We never sell it or use it for advertising or AI training, and you can delete it at any time."
>
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>Creators Club (“we”, “us”) is operated by ORUMIND, Hyderabad, Telangana, India. Creators Club connects creators and brands: creator profiles and verification, brand campaigns and collaborations, a seller workspace for products and orders, and Instagram and YouTube consoles that automate replies to comments and messages. This policy covers creatorsclub.co.in, app.creatorsclub.co.in, console.creatorsclub.co.in, api.creatorsclub.co.in and the Creators Club mobile app. Questions: use our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account data:</strong> phone number and email, username, password and MPIN (stored only as one-way hashes), and your profile details.</li>
    <li><strong>Verification (KYC):</strong> for creators, identity verification through DigiLocker with your consent. We do not store your Aadhaar number, only a salted one-way hash and a masked form such as XXXX-XXXX-1234. For brands, PAN and GSTIN verification details.</li>
    <li><strong>From Meta, when you connect Instagram</strong> (only the permissions you approve): account ID, username, profile picture, follower and media counts, recent posts and reels, and access tokens stored encrypted.</li>
    <li><strong>From Google, when you connect YouTube</strong> (only the scopes you approve): channel ID, name, statistics and recent videos, comments on your videos, and access tokens stored encrypted. Our use of YouTube data follows the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms">YouTube Terms of Service</a> and the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>About people who interact with a connected account:</strong> their platform-scoped ID and username, the comment or message text, messages our automations sent them, and clicks on tracked links.</li>
    <li><strong>Orders and payments:</strong> buyer name, email, phone and delivery address for orders. Payments are processed by Razorpay; we never see card or UPI credentials.</li>
    <li><strong>Contact form on this website:</strong> your name, email, role and message, used only to reply to you.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address, device and browser type and error logs, for security and troubleshooting.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Run your account, verify creators and brands, and check eligibility criteria such as subscriber and view counts.</li>
    <li>Match comments and messages against your automations, send the replies you set up, and count clicks on tracked links.</li>
    <li>Process orders, payments, refunds and delivery updates.</li>
    <li>Keep Creators Club secure, including checking the signature of every webhook from Meta and Razorpay.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We use data received from Meta and Google only to provide the features you turn on. We don’t sell it, use it for advertising, or use it to train AI models.</p>

  <h2>How we share information</h2>
  <p>We don’t sell or rent personal data. We share it only with Meta and Google (to send replies), Razorpay (payments), DigiLocker (verification you start), service providers that run Creators Club for us (Google Cloud hosting, Cloudflare, Firebase push notifications, email delivery), between a creator and a brand when they collaborate, and when the law requires it.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Instagram and YouTube tokens: until you disconnect the account or remove the app in Meta or Google settings.</li>
    <li>Raw webhook events: up to 14 days. Connection audit logs: up to 365 days.</li>
    <li>Leads, conversations and click history: while your account exists, unless you ask us to delete them sooner.</li>
    <li>Order and payment records: as long as tax and accounting law requires.</li>
    <li>Contact form messages: up to 12 months.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>All traffic uses HTTPS. Social access tokens and sensitive fields are encrypted at rest and never sent to your browser. Passwords and MPINs are stored only as one-way hashes.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live (including under India’s Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 and the GDPR), you can ask to access, correct or delete your data, withdraw consent, or get a copy. Contact us through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>; we respond within 30 days. Grievance Officer (India): reachable through the same page; we acknowledge complaints within 48 hours.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Creators Club isn’t for anyone under 18, and we don’t knowingly collect children’s data.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We’ll post changes here and update the date above.</p>
</LegalLayout>
